    <h1>IS COFFEE HEALTHY</h1>
    <p class="muted">By John Goerke. <time datetime="2018-05-08">May 8, 2018</time> (updated <time datetime="2020-02-05">February 5, 2020</time>).</p>

    <p>This is a historical article, kept as originally framed. It is general information, not medical advice, and it has not been updated with new health claims; talk to a health professional about your own situation.</p>

    <h2>Is Coffee Healthy?</h2>
    <p>Coffee is one of the most widely enjoyed drinks, so it is no surprise that people ask whether it is healthy. The article approaches it as a discussion, with moderation in mind.</p>

    <h2>What Coffee Does to Your Body</h2>
    <p>The article looks at caffeine, and at the polyphenols, phytonutrients and antioxidants found in coffee. See also <a href="/3-cups-of-coffee-a-day-why-it-can-be-good-for-the-health/">3 cups of coffee a day</a> and <a href="/nitro-coffee-health-benefits/">nitro coffee health benefits</a>.</p>
